<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Panembahan Hanyakrawati</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. <a href="/years/1613">1613</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/17th-century">17th century</a> · Also known as Seda ing Krapyak</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Panembahan Hanyakrawati was the second ruler of Mataram in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/java">Java</a>, from 1601 to 1613, the son of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/panembahan-senapati">Panembahan Senapati</a> and father of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sultan-agung">Sultan Agung</a>. He spent his reign putting down revolts by relatives and regional lords and fighting Surabaya. He died in a hunting accident at Krapyak and is remembered as Seda ing Krapyak, 'he who died at Krapyak'.</p></div>
